OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and largely sunny day
OL,6,Fmorning but skies will turn hazy this
OL,7,Fafternoon as some high cloud begins to
OL,8,Fspill in from the northwest. Feeling
OL,9,Fhot, especially in the south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and warm evening to come
OL,12,Fwith some hazy sunshine. Overnight
OL,13,Fcloud will continue to thicken with
OL,14,Fsome rain arriving into northwest
OL,15,FNorthumberland by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
