OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FPatchy outbreaks of rain will
OL,6,Fspread southeastwards throughout
OL,7,FFriday but tending to weaken as they
OL,8,Fdo so. Many areas becoming dry during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon with sunny spells but
OL,10,Ffeeling cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FApart
OL,13,Ffrom a few showers, the weekend will
OL,14,Fbe largely dry with some sunshine. A
OL,15,Fband of rain then likely to move in
OL,16,Fduring Monday. Temperatures nearer to
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
